{"seq":8,"trial_id":"m3-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T05:58:18.045Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6ed8695fa8505bf1c50b2e0eaf0a2243c640cb611963abc13e064cee029006bb","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Kwame, the only figure in this channel is 10%. Bettina posted 12% on 2025-11-17, then corrected it five minutes later to 10%. She said she had misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark. So 12 was a retraction, not the rate.\n\nThat's a Nov 2025 channel message, not the contract. I can't see a Saltmarsh contract or order form in the files I can read for you, so I can't confirm the current rate or whether it changed before the renewal. For the brief, check with June (deal desk). If the renewal goes above 10%, Anselm has to approve it.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":9,"trial_id":"m3-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T05:58:21.125Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"064011776fa2c235c6fbc2a7b3968452485b3872dd65561bce7b04cbccdb8a68","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame, I replied in the thread on your message in #coastal-team. The only discount figure in the channel is 10%.\n\nBettina posted 12% on 2025-11-17 and corrected it to 10% five minutes later. She said she had misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark. So 12 was a retracted figure, not the rate.\n\nThat 10% comes from a November 2025 channel message, not from a contract. I couldn't find a Saltmarsh contract or order form in the files I can read, so I can't confirm the current rate. For the brief, check with June on the deal desk."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
